            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "PamMar"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Usually I just have butter on my pancakes. I'm not a big syrup fan but I'm a huge pumpkin fan so I had to try this with my pumpkin pancakes. I used 2 teaspoons pumpkin pie spice instead of the cinnamon and allspice. Yes, it was more spice than called for but that's how I like it. I will make this again especially when company comes for the hoildays.",
            "datePublished": "2009-10-28T09:16:57.950Z"
          },
          {
