            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lynn S."
            },
            "reviewBody": "I took another reviewer's advice and omitted the cranberry juice and just added some more maple syrup and it was ABSOLUTELY DELICIOUS. Great recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2010-10-30T08:24:47.447Z"
          },
          {
